+# audit/
+
+The append-only audit trail for the agent self-improvement loop.
+
+- `changes.jsonl` — one JSON object per line, one line per lifecycle
+  event. Never rewritten, never truncated.
+- `logger.py` — `append(record)` is the only write path. There is
+  intentionally no `update()`/`delete()`.
+
+## Record shape
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "chg-20260824-153000-ab12cd",
+  "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:30:00Z",
+  "actor": "agent | human:<id>",
+  "target_paths": ["skills/foo/SKILL.md"],
+  "problem": "free-text description of the observed problem",
+  "diff_path": "path to the unified diff that was proposed",
+  "status": "rejected_policy | rejected_apply_failed | rejected_eval | pending_human_approval | approved | promoted | rolled_back",
+  "gates": {"schema_validation": "pass|fail", "regression_evaluation": "pass|fail", "holdout_evaluation": "pass|fail"},
+  "worktree": "path to the isolated worktree, while pending",
+  "branch": "self-improve/<change-id>",
+  "approved_by": "human:<id> | null",
+  "approved_at": "timestamp | null",
+  "promoted_commit": "sha | null",
+  "previous_commit": "sha | null",
+  "rolled_back_to": "sha (rollback records only)"
+}
+```
+
+A given `id` accumulates multiple lines over its lifecycle (proposed →
+approved → promoted, etc.) — `logger.latest_for(id)` returns the most
+recent one, which reflects current status.
+
+**This directory must never be modified by the self-improvement loop**
+beyond the sanctioned `append()` calls made through `evolution/` and
+`deployment/`. No proposed diff may touch it, and the CI guard
+(`.github/workflows/self-improvement-guard.yml`) independently rejects
+any self-improvement branch that does.
