+# auth/
+
+The human-approval gate for the agent self-improvement loop.
+
+- `approvers.json` — the list of human identities authorized to approve
+  and promote changes. An empty list fails closed: no promotions or
+  rollbacks are possible. Agent/bot/CI identities are never valid here.
+- `approvals.py` — `verify_approver(id)`, used by `propose`/`approve`/
+  `promote`/`rollback` in `evolution/self_improve.py` and
+  `deployment/*.py`.
+
+**This directory must never be modified by the self-improvement loop.**
+Only a human operator, editing outside the loop, may change it — in
+particular, add or remove real approver identities.
