+# deployment/
+
+Promotion and rollback rules for the agent self-improvement loop.
+
+- `state.json` — `{"current_commit", "history": [...]}`, the version
+  stack used for rollback.
+- `promote.py` / `promote.sh` — merges an **approved** change's branch
+  into trunk. Requires the promoting human to be the same one who
+  approved it (`auth/approvals.py`).
+- `rollback.py` / `rollback.sh` — **one command**, `deployment/rollback.sh
+  <approver-id> [commit]`, reverts trunk to the previous (or a specific)
+  promoted commit and records it in the audit log.
+
+**This directory must never be modified by the self-improvement loop.**
+Only a human operator, editing outside the loop, may change the
+promotion or rollback mechanics.
